  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9401.01 Applicability. This chapter applies to all wreckers, tow business, and emergency road service organizations who wish to be on the division of state police tow list pursuant to RSA 106-B:26 et. seq, and these rules.\n\nSource. #13550, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 1-31-23, EXPIRES: 7-30-23; ss by #13653, eff 5-26-23",
